1.0.0 (2026-08-11)
https://github.com/CodyTolene/pip-boy-3000-holotapes/pull/84
- Initial public PIP-CO Idle Frameworks submission.
- Cleaned the idle runtime for constrained-memory Pip-Boy hardware.
- Added fullscreen automatic-idle runner to prevent underlying page/header bleed-through.
- Added built-in PIP-BOY 3000 idle and optional Mesmetron idle-provider integration.
- Added live previews for detected Mesmetron screensavers.
- Preserved native Mesmetron frame behavior for persistence-based effects such as Ribbon, Spiral, and Vortex.
- Kept Idle Framework wake controls separate from Mesmetron's normal in-app knob controls.
- Removed hardware-only APPINFO self-registration from the public repository build.
